{"cluster_id": "C-2324", "topic": "A snapshot reuses the RefTxnId of its last", "target": "architecture/manifests-and-refs", "member_ids": ["B011-082"], "canonical_claim": "A snapshot reuses the `RefTxnId` of its last included log, producing one shared ordered timeline where `log X == snapshot X` and later logs have greater identifiers.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-11-cas-ref-table-snapshot-log-design.md#ordered-ref-transaction-identifier"]}
