{"cluster_id": "C-2340", "topic": "The ref-model rev.6 oracle is WStateRev6 == FoldIds(EmptyState", "target": "architecture/manifests-and-refs", "member_ids": ["B014-063"], "canonical_claim": "The ref-model rev.6 oracle is `WStateRev6 == FoldIds(EmptyState, writtenEver \\ droppedEver)`, and the strict `NoDivergentFold` invariant requires every completed reader under `Rev6MountRule` to reconstruct that oracle.", "issue_ids": ["rev.6"], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-13-cas-ref-lease-exclusivity-rev6.md#task-1"]}
{"cluster_id": "C-2341", "topic": "The rev.6 snapshot codec stores optional RefTableSnapshot::sealed_from, uses", "target": "architecture/manifests-and-refs", "member_ids": ["B014-068"], "canonical_claim": "The rev.6 snapshot codec stores optional `RefTableSnapshot::sealed_from`, uses format version 2, rejects version 1 fail-closed, and throws when `sealed_from` is greater than `snapshot_id`.", "issue_ids": ["rev.6"], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-13-cas-ref-lease-exclusivity-rev6.md#task-3"]}
